{
  "id": "LUK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 5",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitanwa kwa bahemba ba kwandya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūngī walī wīmīīla ha ng'walo gwa nyanza ya Genesaleti, a banhū būng'okalīīla kūdegeleka mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbona mato abīlī galī a ha ng'walo gwa nyanza; alīyo a bategi baalī bagaleka, boojaga mitego ha mhūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wingīla mu līmò lyago, lyalī lya ng'wa Simoni, ūng'wīla alīsegeje ho hado, lībize gītī lyagwīngīla ū ng'walo. Hūna wigasha mo, wandya kūbalanga a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kūlanga ūng'wīla ū Simoni gīkī, “Bukaga ūje kū būjiba, ūkategele kwene ī mitego ying'we, mukūgwasha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Simoni ūng'wīla, “Seeba twakoyaga no būjikū pe, alīyo ndūhū nūūlū kūgwasha shose shose; gwike īkī ūlīhaya, nahene naje ko nakītege ī mitego.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīta gīko būgwasha ndīlo ningī no, nose ī mitego yabo yandya kūtandūka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī na bichabo mu lyato līngī, būbashinyela bize babambīlīje. Aho bashika būgokaja pyī būbīlī wago a mato, nose gūyūhaya kūtubīla kūlwa būdito bo ndīlo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Simoni aho wabona gīko, ūtuja mazwi ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Yesu ūhaya gīkī, “Īngaga Seeba ūnileke ū nene, nguno nalī munhū wa shibi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho bapandīka ndīlo ningī gīko, akakumya no, pye na a bangī abo walī nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye na a bategi biye ū Simoni, a ba Yakobo nū Yohana, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Zebedayo nabo bakakumya no. Hūna ū Yesu ūng'wīla ū Simoni gīkī, “Ūtogohage; kūfuma haha ūkūbiza nzubi wa banhū, kūbingīja mu būpanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bagakoja ha ng'walo a mato, būleka pyī ī shikolo, būnondeela wei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwejiwa kwa munhū wa mbiji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe walī mu nzengo gūmò gwaho, walīho ngosha ūmò walī watowa mbiji, aho wamona ū Yesu, winama kūshisha ha sī; kūnū alīng'wikūmbīlīja alīhaya, “Seeba ūlū ūtogwa ūdūgije kūneeja!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūgoloola nkono ūnkuumya; kūnū alīng'wīla gīkī, “Natogagwa elaga!” Haho na haho ī mbiji jūng'wīnga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnkomeleja ū munhū ng'wenūyo gīkī atizūng'wīla munhū nūūlū ūmò, alīyo ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkiyooleche kūlī ngabīji, ūkafunye na shakwinha kūlwa kwejiwa kwako, gīt'ūmo Musa alagīlile; būbize ho būkaanīji kūbo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūkumo lokwe lūkasambaala, būyūng'okalīīla banhū bingī kwiza kūndegeleka, na kūpījiwa ndwala jabo ja būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū wei wisundaga waja kū mapandī gatī na banhū, kūjūlomba iyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa munhū wa būsaatu wa mangwisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūshikū lūngī hangī walangaga, baalī bigasha ho na Bafalisayo hamò na balangi ba shilagīlo, ba kūfuma mu magūngūli gose, a ga mu Galilaya, nī Būyudaya; pye na Yelusalemu. Ū būdūla bo ng'wa Seeba boolī hamò nang'hwe kūlwa kūpīja basaatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla bashika bagosha babūūkije munhū ha shilago, walī na būsaatu wa mangwisha; ī ng'hūmbū jabo jalī kūnshisha ha būtongi bo ng'wa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī a banhū baalī bingī būgayiwa ī nzīla ya kūnshisha aho walī ū Yesu. Būlinha kwigūlya ya numba būūkagahega a malongo na a mazengo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mazengo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī numba ja Baisilaeli ī shikū jenījo jaalī ja mbika ya matembe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hū būng'wicha nī shilago shakwe būntūūla ha gatī gatī ha būtongi bo ng'wa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wakūbona ū kūzunya kwabo, ūhaya, “Bahebu olekejiagwa ī shibi shako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A balangi ba shilagīlo na a Bafalisayo bandya kūng'ung'uula balīhaya, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyū ni nani ī gete agūhayaga mihayo ya nyagimu gīko? Nani ūyo adūgije kūlekeja shibi ūlū atī Mulungu dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbūdeeba ū būng'ung'uuji wabo, hūna ūshosha alībawīla gīkī, “Nibūlī mukūng'ung'uulaga ū mung'holò jing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ū nogu ni gūlī ginehe? Ū gwa kūhaya gīkī, ‘Walekejiagwa ī shibi shako;’ nūūlū hamo ū gwa kūhaya gīkī, ‘Būūkaga ūshimīze?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, shiigelile mumane gīkī ū Ng'wana o Munhū alī nabo ū būdūla bo kūlekeja shibi ū mu sī.” Hūna ūng'wīla ū nsaatu gīkī, “Nalīkūwīla būūkaga, ūshibūūche ī shilago shako ūje kaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ūbūūka haho na haho mu būtongi wabo, ūshibūūcha ī shilago īsho walī ashilaalīlile, ūgumha ajile kaya akūnkumīlījaga Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye būgwīlwa idedebaja, bogoha no; būyūnkumīlīja Mulungu gwike, kūnū bakwiwīlaga gīkī, “Lelo twabona mihayo ya kūkamaaja!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitanwa kwa ng'wa Lawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahayūbīta ī yenīyo, ūfuma wīnga a henaho; ūmona ntobisha wa goodi, lina lyakwe Lawī, igashije ng'witobisījo lya goodi; ūng'wīla, “Nilondeelage.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshileka pyī ī shikolo, ūbūūka ūnondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lawī aho washika ha ng'wakwe ūmeegeja shigukulu shitaale ū Yesu. Lyalīho n'ibita itaale lya batobisha ba goodi na banhū bangī; nabo bigasha ū kūlya ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a Bafalisayo na a balangi babo ba shilagīlo būyūduguma ū kū bahemba bakwe; bakūbawīlaga gīkī, “Nibūlī mukūlyaga na kūng'wa hamò na batobisha ba goodi, būyaga na banhū ba shibi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūshosha ūbawīla, “A banhū a bapanga batī na nguno na mfumu, alīyo a basaatu h'abo bakankoobaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene natizile kwitana batūngīlīja, alīyo ba shibi; gīkī bagalūke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shīmīle sha kūfunga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būng'wīla gīkī, “Ng'hangala ningī a bahemba ba ng'wa Yohana bakabizaga na ikanza lya kūfunga na kūlomba, pye na a ba Bafalisayo bakīītaga ī gīko; lelo a bako bene ni bakūlyaga na kūng'wa dūhū shi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Mudūgije kūbīīta bafunge a bageni ba ha būkwīlīma, alīyo nū ntooji ataalī hamò nabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jikūshika ī shikū ja kwīngījiwa ū ntooji, ū mu shikū jenījo hū bakūyūfunga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla lūsumo gīkī. “Atīho ūyo akatandūlaga shilaka kwīnga ha ng'wenda mpya wasumīīla ha ng'wenda nkūlūkūlū. Ūlū wīta gīko akūbiza wagūtandūla nū mpya, yūkenaagūka būbīlī wayo; nguno ū ng'wenda ū nkūlūkūlū gūtizunīlīja nī shilaka ī shipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī atīho ūyo akabīkaga mvinya mhya ng'wibīkīlo ikūlūkūlū, ūlū wīta gīko, ī mvinya ī mhya īkūlītandūla ī libīkīlo ī likūlūkūlū; yidīka ha sī ī mvinya, nī libīkīlo lyūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mvinya ī mhya shiigelile ībīkwe ng'wibīkīlo ipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hangī atīho munhū wa kūng'wa shakūng'wa sha kale hūna hangī ūshoka kwikūmva shisūhya; nguno akūhaya gīkī ī sha kale shinonu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
